{% doc %}
  @prompt
    【LP構成：商品詳細セクション】
    ・全体の雰囲気：クリーン、ミニマル、高級感のあるスキンケアブランド。
    ・レイアウト：2カラム構成（商品のメイン画像(4:5)を大きく配置。その下に、テクスチャーや使用シーンを示す4枚の画像(3:4)、右側にテキストと数量カウンターと購入ボタンと定期購入ボタン）ボタンは左寄せ。
    
    【右側下部のコンテンツ指定】
    ・見出し：「これ1本で叶える、8つのスキンケアポイント」
    ・説明文：「保湿・整肌・保護など、スキンケアに必要な8つの機能をバランスよく配合。毎日のケアで肌本来の美しさを引き出します。」
    ・メディア配置：説明文の直下に、画像(1:1)を1枚配置するためのスロット（プレースホルダー）を作成してください。
    
    【テキスト情報】
    Moisture Veil Spray Pack
    コラーゲンヴェール プッシュパック
    120ml　¥9,800 tax in
    「満ちる透明感 水光肌へ」
    内側からうるおいがにじむような水光肌へ導く美容液。透明感ケアにより乾燥によるくすみを防ぎ、肌本来の防御機能をサポートします。
    ボタンのフォントもひな
    ボタンサイズは統一
    
    ボタン上テキストは、タイトル(価格まで)と説明文の二つに分ける
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-product-detail-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 60px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-left-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-main-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-main-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-main-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 300px;
    max-height: 300px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-sub-images-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-sub-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 4;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-sub-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-sub-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-sub-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-right-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 24px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.title_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.title_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.title_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.title_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subtitle_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-price-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.price_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-quantity-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-quantity-label-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-detail-quantity-controls-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.input_border_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-quantity-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border: none;
    background-color: transparent;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: 18px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-quantity-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg }};
  }

  .ai-product-detail-quantity-input-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 50px;
    height: 40px;
    border: none;
    border-left: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    border-right: 1px solid {{ block.settings.border_color }};
    text-align: center;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.label_font_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-detail-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    padding: 16px 40px;
    border: none;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    cursor: pointer;
    text-decoration: none;
    display: inline-block;
    text-align: center;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-detail-button-primary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.primary_button_hover_bg }};
  }

  .ai-product-detail-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_bg }};
    color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_text_color }};
  }

  .ai-product-detail-button-secondary-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.secondary_button_hover_bg }};
  }

  .ai-product-detail-features-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-top: 20px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-features-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.features_heading_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-features-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.body_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.body_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.body_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.features_description_size }}px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px 0;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-features-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.image_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-features-image-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-product-detail-features-image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

